  "description": "The Mandelbulb is a three-dimensional fractal construct developed in 2009 by Daniel White and Paul Nylander. It extends the classic complex Mandelbrot iteration  \\mapsto z^n + c$ into 3D using spherical coordinates  \\mapsto (r^8, 8\\theta, 8\\phi) + \\mathbf{c}$. Evaluated with volumetric raymarching distance estimation in Three.js.",
